g d"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"irectory, then prompt the local Agent to load the skill after running."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"# Collection List"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"No entries yet. Contributions are welcome."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"# Contribution Guidelines"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Welcome to contribute in the following ways:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. **Submit entries**: Create corresponding `AGENTS.md` files in the `src/` directory according to t"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"he project structure requirements\n2. **Report issues**: Submit Issues to report bugs or suggest impr"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ovements\n3. **Improve documentation**: Optimize existing documents or translate multilingual version"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"s\n4. **Develop features**: Implement new features or optimize workflows"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Please ensure you follow the project guidelines and maintain consistent code style."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"# License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"This project is licensed under the MIT License"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Copyright © 2026 JularDepick, see COPYRIGHT for details."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
